wiring), so the invariant is untouched by construction — which is an argument, not a measurement. 0554's own Verification already owns building the check, and is where it first bites. ACTION 3, THE CONVENTION, DECIDED: `conductor-integration` is the base for the conductor work from here — 0554, 0565 and 0566 branch from it, not from tranche 2. 0550's branch-per-ticket habit stands; what changes is what they are cut from, because the parallel-sibling experiment cost exactly one merge and would cost another every time two tickets ran at once. Noted on 0550.

